{"code":0,"data":{"title":"快应用账号注册","content":"<h1 id=\"s-oit2rspm\">一、账号说明</h1><h2 id=\"s-30psh7rh\">1、vivo开发者账号</h2><p>（1）用于登录vivo开放平台，账号注册材料要求与操作流程详见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/2\">《企业开发者账号注册》</a>；</p><p>（2）点击去注册：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://id.vivo.com.cn/#/user/login\">vivo开发者账号</a></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260727/if452t/20260727144317040612.png\" width=\"1216\" height=\"568\" data-natural-width=\"1858\" data-natural-height=\"868\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p><h2 id=\"s-51h4yqyl\">2、智慧服务开放平台（原快应用联盟官网）账号</h2><p>（1）用于登录快应用智慧服务开放平台，账号注册材料要求与操作流程详见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.quickapp.cn/document/%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0/?menuId=51&amp;docId=127\">《注册开发者平台账号》</a>；</p><p>（2）点击去注册：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.quickapp.cn/account/register\">智慧服务开放平台账号</a></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260727/0eki2m/20260727144408385852.png\" width=\"1215\" height=\"579\" data-natural-width=\"1833\" data-natural-height=\"874\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p><h1 id=\"s-rnwne6ty\">二、账号绑定说明</h1><p>1、注册智慧服务开放平台账号后，如需从智慧服务开放平台发布快应用至vivo平台，需要申请绑定vivo开发者账号；</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260728/12toce/20260728100833351439.png\" width=\"1214\" height=\"465\" data-natural-width=\"1863\" data-natural-height=\"714\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260727/6u92o7/20260727144613339762.png\" width=\"1214\" height=\"583\" data-natural-width=\"1906\" data-natural-height=\"916\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p>2、账号绑定审核需3-5个工作日，如有疑问请联系平台<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev-smartchat.vivo.com.cn/user\">在线客服</a>。</p>","versionCode":8,"updateTime":1785204602000,"breadCrumbs":"快应用管理,快应用上架管理,快应用账号注册","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}